  "description": "Minor internal and external alterations including replacement awning, signage and alterations to bar",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Unless otherwise hereby approved, all new in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works to be carried out in this connection) shall match the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution and finished appearance.\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure a satisfactory external appearance and safeguard the significance of the listed building.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the details as included within the &#x27;Awning Specifications Rev A (14/10/2025)&#x27; document hereby approved, the awning when extended shall have a vertical clearance of 2.4 metres above the footway below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: For the avoidance of doubt and to safeguard pedestrian and highway safety.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>"
  ],
